    <li>One quantified theorem and explicit constructor for every admissible <Math tex={String.raw`(n,m)`} />, with all finite dependencies discharged.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Download the <a href="/cop-prisoner/lean-proofs.zip">Lean sources</a>, install the pinned toolchain and run <code>python3 check.py</code> inside the extracted <code>lean</code> folder. It rebuilds every distributed module one module at a time, with two Lean workers and rejects source changes during replay. The <a href="/cop-prisoner/lean/README.md">theorem and replay guide</a> gives precise statements. The research archive contains the dependency-ordered roadmap; the <a href="/cop-prisoner/paper/#evidence-guide">evidence guide</a> separately describes the ordinary and external computational proofs.</p>
